                                Available: ₹<%= retryVaultBalance.toLocaleString('en-IN') %>
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 font-light">
                            <% if (canRetryWithWallet) { %>
                                Instant settlement deducted directly from your verified Vault reserve.
                            <% } else { %>
                                <span class="text-amber-800">Insufficient balance (Shortfall: ₹<%= (Math.max(0, Number(order.grandTotal) - retryVaultBalance)).toLocaleString('en-IN') %>)</span>
